After each round there is a discussion phase. In it you can message one teammate, your partner, on the discussion channel you share with that teammate (see the channel list below for each exact channel_id). Your partner is the first teammate you message in that discussion phase. After that, a message to any other teammate is not sent. You choose a partner again in each discussion phase. You read every message a teammate sends you in the discussion phase, from your partner or from any other teammate. Use the discussion phase to agree on conventions for future rounds. Messages in the discussion phase do NOT count toward your character score.
